### Criar Consent
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/consents
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "payer": { "document": "12345678901", "name": "Alice Silva" },
  "receiverKey": { "type": "EMAIL", "value": "loja@merchant.com" },
  "policy": {
    "frequency": "MONTHLY",
    "amount": "99.90",
    "currency": "BRL",
    "firstCharge": "2026-05-01",
    "maxOccurrences": 12
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("consentId", response.body.consentId); %}

### Autorizar Consent
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/consents/{{consentId}}/authorize

### Consultar Consent
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/consents/{{consentId}}

### Criar Subscription
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "consentId": "{{consentId}}",
  "externalReference": "invoice-2026-05"
}

> {% client.global.set("subscriptionId", response.body.subscriptionId); %}

### Agendar Charge
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/charges
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "subscriptionId": "{{subscriptionId}}",
  "amount": "99.90",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "scheduledFor": "2026-04-19"
}

> {% client.global.set("chargeId", response.body.chargeId); %}

### Consultar Charge
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/charges/{{chargeId}}

### Webhook de settlement (simulando BC)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/bcb/charge-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chargeId": "{{chargeId}}",
  "endToEndId": "E12345678202604190000ABCDEFGHIJK",
  "status": "SETTLED",
  "occurredAt": "2026-04-19T15:00:00Z"
}

### Revogar Consent
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/consents/{{consentId}}/revoke
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{ "reason": "user requested cancellation" }

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Prometheus metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
